Subject: [PATCH] GUIInfoManager: keep info blocks alive across concurrent reads

Backport of Kodi upstream 864cb9b8518ffa34f040551cee5efa2d5422a10a
https://github.com/xbmc/xbmc/pull/29235
Adapted to CoreELEC/xbmc acc0fc66bc6af69c31a93c5d17e36900343263b7.
Retains Kodi 21.3's CGUIInfo::m_info member and explicit critical-section locks.

